abstract: >-
  Bilateral deficiency is defined as the minimum deficiency of a bipolar
  residual restriction. The manuscript proves a size-preserving bijection
  with independent dominating sets, develops its algebra and fixed-width
  complexity, and shows that it is the exact gap coordinate for regular graphs
  equipped with a dominating induced matching. The candidate is unrefereed.
